  "solution": "Chọn hệ trục <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mi>x</mi><mi>y</mi></mrow></semantics></math>, có điểm <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mi>O</mi></semantics></math> trùng với điểm <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mi>B</mi></semantics></math>, các tia <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow></semantics></math>, <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mi>y</mi></mrow></semantics></math> tương ứng trùng với các tia <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>B</mi><mi>A</mi></mrow></semantics></math> và <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>B</mi><mi>C</mi></mrow></semantics></math>. <br>Khi đó ta có tọa độ các điểm như sau <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>B</mi><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>;</mo><mn>0</mn><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow></mrow></semantics></math>; <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mn>11</mn><mo>;</mo><mn>0</mn><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow></mrow></semantics></math>; <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>C</mi><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>;</mo><mn>14</mn><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow></mrow></semantics></math>; <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>D</mi><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mn>11</mn><mo>;</mo><mn>14</mn><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow></mrow></semantics></math>; <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>E</mi><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mn>11</mn><mo>;</mo><mn>4</mn><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow></mrow></semantics></math> và <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>F</mi><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mn>5</mn><mo>;</mo><mn>14</mn><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow></mrow></semantics></math>.<br>Nam có thể quăng lưỡi câu tối thiểu bằng khoảng cách từ <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mi>B</mi></semantics></math> đến đường thẳng <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>E</mi><mi>F</mi></mrow></semantics></math>.<br>Ta có <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mover><mrow><mi>E</mi><mi>F</mi></mrow><mo accent=\"true\">→</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mo>−</mo><mn>6</mn><mo>;</mo><mn>10</mn><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow></mrow></semantics></math>. Ta chọn <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mover><mi>n</mi><mo accent=\"true\">→</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mn>5</mn><mo>;</mo><mn>3</mn><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow></mrow></semantics></math> làm véc-tơ pháp tuyến của đường thẳng <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>E</mi><mi>F</mi></mrow></semantics></math>.<br>Khi đó phương trình tổng quát của đường thẳng <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>E</mi><mi>F</mi></mrow></semantics></math> là \n\t\t<div class=\"math-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>E</mi><mi>F</mi><mo>:</mo><mn>5</mn><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>11</mn><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>4</mn><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>⇔</mo><mn>5</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>y</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>67</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mi>.</mi></mrow></semantics></math></div>\n\t\tKhoảng cách từ vị trí <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mi>B</mi></semantics></math> đến đường thẳng <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>E</mi><mi>F</mi></mrow></semantics></math> là\n\t\t<div class=\"math-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mi>B</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>E</mi><mi>F</mi><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow><mo>=</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">|</mo><mn>5</mn><mo>⋅</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>⋅</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>−</mo><mn>67</mn><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">|</mo></mrow><msqrt><mrow><msup><mn>5</mn><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mn>3</mn><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></msqrt></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mn>67</mn><msqrt><mn>34</mn></msqrt></mfrac><mo>≈</mo><mn>11</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>5</mn><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mrow><mspace width=\"0.222em\"/><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi></mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow><mi>.</mi></mrow></semantics></math></div>",
